# ---- HOOK AUTO-GENERATED NOISE ------------------------------
# Aggregates: daily metric JSON files churn every session
.claude/hooks/aggregates/
# State files. The directory holds two different kinds of file and the split
# matters. Volatile throttle/dedup state, undo snapshots and probe dumps stay
# ignored: they churn every session, run to megabytes, and mean nothing off
# this machine.
#
# DURABLE EVIDENCE is re-included below. It is small, append-only or rarely
# written, and NOT re-derivable. The trust-contract ledger is the only record
# that the contract ever passed, and the cadence stamps are the only thing that
# says when each weekly sweep last ran. Until 2026-09-10 the blanket rule meant
# the vault's own reliability evidence had no off-machine copy at all, on a
# machine whose only backup is this repo.
#
# NOTE THE TRAILING /* . Writing `_state/` excludes the DIRECTORY, and git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so every
# negation below would silently do nothing. Pinned by
# test_state_evidence_is_tracked.py.
.claude/hooks/_state/*
!.claude/hooks/_state/trust-contract-ledger.jsonl
!.claude/hooks/_state/*-cadence.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/vault-backup.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/enforcement-claims.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/orphan-baseline.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/kb-index-budget.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/root-allowlist.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/git-credential-scope.json
!.claude/hooks/_state/self-heal-promotion-state.json
# Rotating log files
.claude/hooks/logs/

