Archives/Claude-Code-Workshop/work/pr-review-playground-local/

# ---- BLUEPRINT RUNNER OUTPUT (never committed on any clone) ----------
# bootstrap_machine.py --apply renders five fully resolved files, two GitHub
# PATs among them, and it stages them in a tempfile.mkdtemp OUTSIDE the
# checkout and deletes that directory in a finally. These two entries are the
# second layer: an ignore rule protects one repository, the temp directory
# protects every clone, and a target's 30-minute autosave commits everything
# not ignored. Added 2026-09-22 after the architect review measured the old
# staging path (<target>/.claude/blueprint/rendered) as a tracked core-bucket
# directory with four of the five rendered files unignored.
.claude/blueprint/rendered/
.claude/blueprint/bootstrap-values.json
